WEBVTT

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.920
<i>My name is Midorikawa Nao.</i>

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.170
<i>I'm blessed with loads of brothers and sisters.</i>

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:18.530
<i>Starting with the eldest, there's Keita, Haru, Hina, Yuuta and Kouta.</i>

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:20.770
Kouta!

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.500
Don't do that, Kou-chan!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:27.270
<i>And soon, there'll be another member of our family joining us!</i>

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.800
Mommy!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.970
Whoa!

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.280
<i>I love my family very much...</i>

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:40.210
<i>And as the eldest of the seven, I have a lot to live up to!</i>

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:45.560
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.430
Smile Precure!

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.300
Let's go!

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.830
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.960
All together!

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.570
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.770
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.440
Smile Precure!

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:02.280
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:07.750
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:12.920
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:18.850
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:23.730
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:23.730
So bright!

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:28.980
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:35.070
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.910
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:37.070
Let's go!

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.660
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:42.700
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:47.500
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.080
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.630
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:50.840
Everybody!

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.340
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:55.090
Fly to the future!

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:58.590
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.700
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.070
Smile Precure!

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:11.000
Alright, I'm taking your mother off to the hospital.

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:13.440
Stand up straight, please!

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.200
All together now!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.850
Goodbye, Mommy! Good luck!

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:24.380
Thank you, dears. I'll make sure I bring a beautiful baby home!

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:29.520
Nao, I'll need you to look after your siblings today, alright?

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:33.320
No problem! Leave it to me!

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.010
So it's gonna be either today or tomorrow, then?!

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:51.480
Indeed. Her parents were headed to the hospital this morning, I believe.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.910
That means Nao's gotta be lookin' after her family, right?

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:55.980
It must be a lot of work.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.650
Oh, Nao seemed quite jubilant.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:04.320
Mom's put me in charge of the kids today!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:09.930
I'm gonna have six brothers and sisters to look after soon, so I'd better get used to it!

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:11.070
Oh, wow!

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:12.630
Guess that's Nao for ya.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:16.300
How exciting! I'd love to cradle a cute baby in my arms!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.840
I wanna hold it too-kuru!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.140
Hey, guys!

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:22.970
We should do something to help Nao-chan out!

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:37.760
Majorina-san!

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.240
What do you want, Joker-da wasa?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.900
What do I <i>want</i>? You're remarkably calm, aren't you?

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.730
Pierrot-sama, on the other hand, is not!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.770
He's not?!

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:55.100
Have you not noticed the absence of Wolfrun-san and Akaoni-san lately?

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:59.710
This, too, will be your last chance.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:05.380
I suggest you use your vulgar tricks and throw down the gauntlet to Cure March, yes?

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:08.050
Of course, should you fail in this task...

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.520
I don't intend to-da wasa!

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:16.900
I'll leave it to you, then.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.270
Curry! Curry! Curry!

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:29.700
Hey, Nao-chan! What brings you all here today?

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:30.800
Well, Mister...

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.340
We're gonna have a new brother or sister!

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:34.380
Mommy went to the hospital to give birth!

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:36.330
Oh, how time flies!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:42.290
So I thought I'd make everyone's favorite dinner: Mom's special curry!

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.120
Here, Nao-onee, onions.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.420
And potatoes!

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:47.900
Thank you!

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.430
Umm...

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:53.970
Here. The carrots are on me.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:56.730
Thanks, Mister!

00:04:56.730 --> 00:05:00.090
Here, Nao-oneechan! Carrots!

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.690
Thanks, sir!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.180
A pleasure doing business with ya!

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:05.840
Oh, hey there, Nao-chan!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.480
Good afternoon!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.090
We need some meat for our curry.

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:11.980
Yay, meat!

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:14.680
Midorikawa-san's expecting her kid today.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:17.860
Is she now? Well, that's worth celebrating!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.930
Oh, is she expecting her seventh today?

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.430
Yeah, she is.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.940
Here you go, on the house.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:29.100
Thank you so much, sir!

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.370
Wow, look at the size of it!

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.890
I can't afford to lose, not again-da wasa...

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:44.320
Curry! Curry!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.480
Yes, I may have a plan-da wasa!

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.460
Man, these onions sting my eyes!

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:58.590
Mommy!

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.590
Mommy's at the hospital.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:04.640
That's right! You're gonna be big bros soon, so you've gotta be good!

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.580
Okay.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:07.810
Okay!

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:11.640
Maybe I'll get to be more like Nao-oneechan too!

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.130
Keita, could you wipe the table for me?

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:15.150
Okay!

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:17.950
Haru, can you get me a nice big stirring spoon?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.450
Sure!

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:20.970
Dang it!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:22.960
What's wrong?

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.920
I forgot to buy the apples...

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:29.090
Apples are the vital ingredient for Mom's curry...

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.560
Aww, come on! Now what're we gonna do?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.270
That's a good question...

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.390
If I went and got them, we'd never get dinner done on time...

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:39.970
Do the apples really matter?

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:39.970
Hey, Hina!

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:43.070
It won't be Mom's curry without them!

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:41.870
Let's get apples!

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:44.100
Okay!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.810
Bananas! Just use bananas instead!

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:48.910
No way am I using bananas!

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:49.910
So, what then?

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:57.560
Maybe we could help by playing with her little brothers and sisters!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.620
I can help too-kuru!

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.660
I want to draw pictures with them!

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:05.110
Nao's gonna be the oldest of seven, huh?

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.630
She could be a pro big sis!

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:13.100
I still remember her joy at having a sibling for the first time.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.200
Hey, Reika-chan!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:25.320
I guess this makes me the big sis!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:32.390
Nao values her family above all else.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.290
Yeah.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.590
Ya got that right.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:37.530
Nao-chan!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.060
Guys...

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.670
What's wrong?

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:43.550
Nao-onee!

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:44.870
Nao-oneechan!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.470
Hina and Yuuta have wandered off somewhere...!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.380
Where do we get apples?

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.120
From the shops, of course!

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.580
This is my big chance-da wasa...

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.450
March!

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.440
March!

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:24.610
Hina! Yuuta!

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:26.730
Hina-chan!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.580
Hina-chan, kuru!

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.120
Yuuta-kun!

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.320
I haven't seen them, I'm afraid...

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.920
Nope.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.810
Hina! Yuuta!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.660
I'll need you to look after your siblings.

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.370
Nao-onee!

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:52.720
Nao-oneechan, I just thought...

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.410
...what if Hina and Yuuta went to get...

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.110
...apples!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.430
Apples?

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.580
Thank you very much!

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.490
Excuse me!

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.990
Yes, ma'am?

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:18.060
We can't buy apples without any money...

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.730
So whadda we do?

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:21.000
I dunno...

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.000
Looking for some apples, are you-da wasa?

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:30.020
Mister, have you seen Hina and Yuuta anywhere?

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:34.860
Yeah, I saw them over there a second ago.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.820
But then they just up and vanished...

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:40.180
They <i>were</i> trying to get apples...

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.390
They might still be nearby!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.710
Let's look, Nao-onee!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:46.290
Right! Thanks, Mister!

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:49.400
I don't think they could have gone very far!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.730
What's the matter?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.000
I don't know...

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:57.210
Here you go! A fresh, tasty apple-da wasa...

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.410
And it's all yours, if you want it-da wasa!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:03.830
Wow, really?

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.470
Please, take it-da wasa!

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:06.770
Thanks, lady!

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:19.010
Hina! Yuuta!

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:21.690
Nao-oneechan!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.090
Isn't that...

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.300
Hina! Yuuta!

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:28.670
Cure March! It's you-da wasa!

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:30.950
Majorina?!

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:32.800
Nao-oneechan!

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.310
Nao-oneechan!

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:36.330
Hina! Yuuta!

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:37.510
Release my family!

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:41.110
It's come to the crunch for us two.

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:45.680
Your story ends right here, right now-da wasa, Cure March!

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:47.720
"Cure March"?

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:49.720
Who's that?

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.150
Not gonna fight me-da wasa?

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.130
Then I'll just have to come get <i>you-da wasa!</i>

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.120
Run for it!

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:01.400
The heck?!

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.260
<i>What do I do...?! I can't let her hurt them...</i>

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.500
<i>But I can't transform in front of the kids, either!</i>

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:11.380
Haru!

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:13.180
Say your prayers, brats-da wasa!

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:25.420
I am not letting you hurt my siblings!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.400
Ready?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:33.670
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:34.740
Go!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.440
Go, go!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:39.320
Let's Go: March!

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:06.530
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.620
Cure March!

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:15.840
Nao-onee...

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:23.010
Keita. Get Haru and Kouta out of here, now.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:25.710
Okay.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:26.990
Come on, Haru!

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.690
So, you're finally gonna fight me, are you-da wasa?

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.960
Keita, Haru, Kouta!

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:47.530
Come on out, Hyper Akanbe!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:01.050
Hyper Akanbe!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.450
Hina! Yuuta!

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.860
Good plan, isn't it-da wasa?! You're helpless against me now-da wasa!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:14.060
You see, I've figured out your one weakness-da wasa!

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:21.700
Get a load of this!

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.610
Hyper!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:36.290
It's the perfect plan-da wasa! I can get you to throw yourself in the path of my attacks-da wasa!

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:46.160
I'll protect my family, no matter what...

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:50.130
I won't let you hurt them!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.540
Nao-onee...

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.180
I will look after my family...

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.030
Let's end this-da wasa!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:11.960
Get away from her!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.260
Don't hurt Nao-oneechan!

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:18.030
Keita, Haru, Kouta!

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:19.620
'Neechan!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.430
Nao-oneechan!

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.400
Hina, Yuuta!

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.870
Leave our sister alone!

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:32.880
Annoying brats! Fine, I'll wipe out all of you at once-da wasa!

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:39.150
Keita, Haru! Get out of here!

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.850
There'll be no escape for any of you-da wasa!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:44.820
'Neechan...

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:48.830
Akanbe!

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:06.510
Say goodbye to your stupid family-da wasa!

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:15.520
I'll protect them, no matter what...!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:22.760
Akan?!

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:24.230
What the-da wasa—?!

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:29.930
Give me back Hina and Yuuta, right now...!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.900
Hyper!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:39.440
I can't afford...

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:42.480
...to lose to you!

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.890
Stupid brat!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.710
Precure...

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:06.620
March Shoot...

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:11.170
Impact!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.650
I won't lose...

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.960
I can't lose!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.320
Now stand back and watch...

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:46.080
...as your family is eradicated from the face of the earth!

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.630
NOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:05.400
How was that, runt?! You like that?!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.930
Keita...

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:16.850
Haru...

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:18.810
Kouta...

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:29.050
March!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:33.520
You alright?!

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.160
What?!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:40.670
No!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.600
Nao-oneechan!

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:44.740
Nao-onee!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.990
Nao-oneechan...

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:48.860
Nao-oneechan!

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:08.130
I'm so glad... you're all safe...

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:16.270
You impudent obnoxious brats!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.870
Hyper Akanbe!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:20.840
Let's Go: Umbrella!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:29.180
We will not let you hurt our friend, or her family!

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.020
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:43.180
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.540
May the light of hope shine!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:55.020
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.020
Precure...

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:00.740
Royal Rainbow...

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:03.200
Burst!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:15.300
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.400
That's another new Décor-kuru!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:26.800
What's going to happen to me now-da wasa...?!

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:33.480
They're fast asleep...

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.110
Must be tired, after that.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.020
At least they're all unhurt.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:37.940
Yeah.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.570
Thanks, guys...

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:49.790
I can never repay you...

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:53.970
Nao-chan.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:02.940
I was so scared... I'd never... <i>I was so scared...!</i>

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.230
It's alright.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:08.880
Everything's gonna be alright.

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:12.250
We're all here together.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.000
Nao!

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:24.760
Dad!

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.400
Does that mean...?!

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:35.670
Nao-oneechan, I had the weirdest dream!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.640
Me too!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:42.110
I don't remember it well, but you were fighting some monster!

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.220
I saw that too!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.780
You were so cool, Nao-oneechan!

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.120
I dreamt it too!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:51.090
'Nee-tan!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.820
Isn't that weird?

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.740
How cute!

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:11.040
It's a girl...

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.120
We're naming her Yui.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:19.380
It's a name that means a binding tie. And I hope she'll help bring the people around her closer together...

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:22.220
Yui...

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:24.690
Yui! Yui!

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.570
Yui...

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:40.200
<i>My name is Midorikawa Nao.</i>

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:44.310
<i>I'm blessed with loads of brothers and sisters.</i>

00:21:44.310 --> 00:21:52.320
<i>Keita, Haru, Hina, Yuuta and Kouta, and now... Yui.</i>

00:21:56.360 --> 00:22:00.730
<i>I love my family so much...</i>

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:41.120
Wait, Reika-chan?! You're gonna go study abroad?!

00:23:41.130 --> 00:23:42.760
What's an "abroad"-kuru?

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:44.660
It means she's goin' to a different country to learn stuff...

00:23:44.660 --> 00:23:47.070
Well, if it's gonna help her, guess we should be happy...

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:48.800
Congrats, Reika-chan...

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:49.840
Good luck...

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:51.840
You have our support...

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:54.340
Is this the path I should walk?

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:56.920
I don't want you to go-kuru!

00:23:57.430 --> 00:23:58.880
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:04.660
Find your ultra happy smile!
